<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston ups 2 aluminum stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston ups 2 aluminum stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it raised the rating on Aluminum Co of America and Alcan Aluminium Ltd to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Alcoa aded 3/8 to 71-1/4, while Alcan rose 1/8 to 35-3/4.</p>
